      "en": {
         "seven_days": "The figure above shows the forecast for the 7-day interval between 04/22/2026 and 04/28/2026, forecast of a predominance of precipitation deficits (orange) along the main course of the Amazon River in Brazilian and Peruvian territories, the Juruena River basin, the basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast and northwest of the state of Pará, and the Napo, Teles Pires, and Ucayali basins. Forecast of predominantly positive precipitation anomalies (blue) over the Beni, Branco, Juruá, Marañon, and Ucayali river basins. Precipitation near climatological norms (white) is forecast for the remaining monitored basins.",
         "fourteen_days": "The figure above shows the prognosis for the 7-day interval between 04/29/2026 and 05/05/2026, forecast of a predominance of precipitation deficits (orange) over the main course of the Amazon River in Peruvian territory, the Branco, Curuá Una, Guaporé Içá, Iriri, and Mamoré river basins, the basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast and northwest of the state of Pará, and the Napo, Negro, Teles Pires, and Xingu basins. No positive precipitation anomalies (blue) are forecast for the monitored region. Precipitation close to climatological norms (white) is forecast for the other monitored basins."
